{"id":57506,"date":"2026-08-07T10:39:33","date_gmt":"2026-08-07T09:39:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilho-das-oliveiras-morais\/"},"modified":"2026-08-28T19:17:40","modified_gmt":"2026-08-28T18:17:40","slug":"trilho-das-oliveiras-morais","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilho-das-oliveiras-morais\/","title":{"rendered":"Trilho das Oliveiras Morais 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 1 - DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre O <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trilho das Oliveiras Morais 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trilho das Oliveiras Morais 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>11 de Outubro de 2026 (Domingo)<\/strong>, em <strong>Macedo De Cavaleiros Braganca<\/strong> (Macedo De Cavaleiros Braganca, distrito de Braganca). Trata-se de um evento desportivo emblem\u00e1tico da regi\u00e3o, reunindo centenas de participantes entre atletas federados, amadores e entusiastas do desporto ao ar livre, promovendo o contacto com a natureza e o patrim\u00f3nio local.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Com partidas agendadas a partir das <strong>09:00<\/strong>, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza o programa <strong>Trail Longo, Trail Curto e Caminhada<\/strong>, adaptado a m\u00faltiplos n\u00edveis de prepara\u00e7\u00e3o f\u00edsica. Se procura preparar o seu calend\u00e1rio de provas, pode consultar o nosso direct\u00f3rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-braga\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;\">calend\u00e1rio de corridas em Braga<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento conta com o apoio de entidades locais e de uma equipa t\u00e9cnica empenhada em garantir elevados padr\u00f5es de seguran\u00e7a, sinaliza\u00e7\u00e3o rigorosa e uma experi\u00eancia memor\u00e1vel para todos os corredores e acompanhantes.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: M\u00d3DULO 2 - FICHA T\u00c9CNICA --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0